er 2 Notenzeilen).</rend></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Eine Partiturdarstellung ist in der Funktion "Versionen vergleichen" möglich.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-ass-695"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Ass 695</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Ass 695-2-1I</identifier><title>Factus homo sumpta</title><incip><incipText><p>Factus homo sumpta</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="2">f. 2, l. 1</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 47, 393</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Agnus</term><term type="genre">tropiert</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Charles M. Atkinson</term><term type="Endseite">2</term><term type="Startposition">I</term><term type="Endzeile">4</term><term type="Melodiennummer_Katalog">Schildbach 114</term><term type="Cantus_ID">509505</term><term type="Nachtragsschicht">Nachtrag</term><term type="Band_Genre">Ordinariumsgesänge</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Ass 695</identifier><titleStmt><title>Ass 695</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Reims (möglicherweise)</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen französischer Herkunft</geogName><date>13. Jh 2. Viertel</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Tropar, Prosar</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Ms. 695</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Assisi</geogName><corpName>Fondo Antico presso la Biblioteca del Sacro Convento</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monod